1.text:
The obligation under the ESA is assessed annually based on the January 1 headcount for that calendar year (with the electronic-monitoring duty crystallizing in October 2022 for qualifying 2022 employers). Once the threshold is not met on the next January 1, the statutory duty to maintain/distribute either policy ceases for the new year; any prior-year violation does not carry forward as ongoing non-compliance.

D therefore became compliant on 1 January 2023. Only C remains non-compliant on 2 January 2023 because its monthly revisions are not distributed within the required 30-day window.

{C}

